<title>USA: Omaha cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Steers - select to choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 65.00-66.00, few loads mostly choice 66.50, package 67.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 65.00-66.00.</p>
</text>
